---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="ERP Intelligence for Multi-Warehouse Distributors"
  description="Live dashboards and exception alerts on top of SAP, NetSuite, Dynamics, Sage, Infor, and Acumatica. Real-time data for multi-warehouse distributors."
>
  <section class="hero-section">
    <div class="wrap hero-grid">
      <div>
        <span class="pill">For multi-warehouse distributors</span>
        <h1 class="hero-title">See what's short, what's overstocked, and where cash is stuck. In real time.</h1>
        <p class="hero-subtitle">We build the data pipeline, live dashboards, and exception alerts on top of SAP and the ERP you already run. Your team opens one screen every morning instead of pulling five reports by hand.</p>
        <div class="hero-buttons">
          <a href="https://links.zenprocess.ai/widget/booking/rcoKJifJJA46bRI9fTEr" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-primary">Book a call</a>
          <a href="/case-study" class="btn btn-ghost">Read the case study</a>
        </div>
        <p class="hero-eyebrow">Led by Vinh Truong, CISSP. 20+ years in enterprise IT and ERP data.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="brief">
        <div class="bar"><b>Purchasing</b><span style="opacity:.8">Live</span><span class="r">Updated 2 min ago</span></div>
        <div class="body">
          <div class="health" style="grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)">
            <div class="h"><div class="lbl-s">Active exceptions</div><div class="n" style="color:#b45309">47</div></div>
            <div class="h"><div class="lbl-s">Below safety stock</div><div class="n" style="color:#dc3545">8</div></div>
            <div class="h"><div class="lbl-s">POs in transit</div><div class="n">124</div></div>
            <div class="h" style="background:var(--green-tint);border-color:var(--green-tint-2)"><div class="lbl-s">Fill rate</div><div class="n" style="color:var(--green-d)">96.4%</div></div>
          </div>
          <p class="lbl-s" style="margin-top:14px">Inventory by warehouse</p>
          <div style="display:flex;align-items:flex-end;gap:8px;height:70px;margin-top:8px">
            <div style="flex:1;background:var(--green);opacity:.7;border-radius:6px 6px 0 0;height:85%"></div>
            <div style="flex:1;background:var(--green);opacity:.7;border-radius:6px 6px 0 0;height:62%"></div>
            <div style="flex:1;background:var(--green);opacity:.7;border-radius:6px 6px 0 0;height:90%"></div>
            <div style="flex:1;background:#f59e0b;opacity:.7;border-radius:6px 6px 0 0;height:40%"></div>
          </div>
          <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:6px" class="eyebrow"><span style="flex:1;text-align:center">Houston</span><span style="flex:1;text-align:center">Dallas</span><span style="flex:1;text-align:center">Atlanta</span><span style="flex:1;text-align:center">NJ</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-familiar reveal">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2 class="section-title">Sound familiar?</h2>
      <div class="familiar-grid">
        <div class="card familiar-card"><h3 class="familiar-title">Inventory turns are too low</h3><p class="familiar-desc">Your team can't see what's moving across warehouses in real time. Everyone works off a different spreadsheet.</p></div>
        <div class="card familiar-card"><h3 class="familiar-title">Stockouts cost you sales</h3><p class="familiar-desc">You find out after the customer calls, not before. No early warning, just firefighting.</p></div>
        <div class="card familiar-card"><h3 class="familiar-title">No single set of numbers</h3><p class="familiar-desc">Purchasing, finance, and sales each pull their own report. Nobody has one live view of the business.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-build reveal">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2 class="section-title">What we build</h2>
      <p class="build-subtitle">Clean data first. Then the dashboards and alerts your team opens every morning. Then AI on top.</p>
      <div class="build-grid">
        <div class="card build-card"><p class="lbl-s build-label">Foundation</p><h3 class="build-title">Data pipeline</h3><p class="build-desc">Your ERP data flows into a clean warehouse. No manual exports.</p></div>
        <div class="card build-card"><p class="lbl-s build-label">Visibility</p><h3 class="build-title">Live dashboards</h3><p class="build-desc">Purchasing, inventory, finance, sales. Real-time, not weekly.</p></div>
        <div class="card build-card"><p class="lbl-s build-label">Early warning</p><h3 class="build-title">Exception alerts</h3><p class="build-desc">Get flagged before a stockout, not after the customer calls.</p></div>
        <div class="card build-card build-card-featured"><p class="lbl-s build-label">On top</p><h3 class="build-title">AI intelligence</h3><p class="build-desc">Forecasts, reorder points, and answers in plain language.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-engagements reveal">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2 class="section-title">How engagements work</h2>
      <div class="eng-grid">
        <div class="card eng-card"><div class="mono eng-num">01</div><h3 class="eng-title">Paid AI audit</h3><p class="eng-desc">We map your data, quantify what the spreadsheets cost you, and hand you a phased plan. Two to four weeks.</p></div>
        <div class="card eng-card"><div class="mono eng-num">02</div><h3 class="eng-title">Phased build</h3><p class="eng-desc">We build the pipeline and dashboards on top of your ERP. No replacement. Your team sees real output in weeks.</p></div>
        <div class="card eng-card"><div class="mono eng-num">03</div><h3 class="eng-title">Your team runs on it</h3><p class="eng-desc">Daily use, training, and handoff. You own everything we build.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-proof reveal text-center">
    <div class="wrap proof-wrap">
      <span class="kicker">What we built for a national building materials distributor</span>
      <div class="stats proof-stats">
        <div><div class="n">3,000+</div><div class="eyebrow">SKUs, multi-warehouse SAP</div></div>
        <div><div class="n">800+</div><div class="eyebrow">daily exceptions flagged</div></div>
        <div><div class="n">0%</div><div class="eyebrow">variance versus SAP</div></div>
        <div><div class="n">16 wks</div><div class="eyebrow">audit to daily use</div></div>
      </div>
      <p class="proof-note">Works with SAP, NetSuite, Microsoft Dynamics, Sage, Infor, and Acumatica.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-final-cta reveal text-center">
    <div class="wrap final-cta-wrap">
      <h2 class="final-cta-title">See what your ERP data can do.</h2>
      <p class="final-cta-desc">A 30-minute call, no pitch deck. We look at how you run today and where the data is stuck.</p>
      <a href="https://links.zenprocess.ai/widget/booking/rcoKJifJJA46bRI9fTEr" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-primary btn-large">Book a call</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .hero-section {
    background: var(--hero-glow);
    padding-top: 84px;
    padding-bottom: 64px;
  }
  .hero-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.05fr .95fr;
    gap: 56px;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .hero-title {
    font-size: clamp(34px, 4.6vw, 54px);
    font-weight: 800;
    margin: 20px 0 18px;
  }
  .hero-subtitle {
    font-size: 20px;
    color: var(--ink-2);
    margin-bottom: 28px;
  }
  .hero-buttons {
    display: flex;
    gap: 14px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .hero-eyebrow {
    margin-top: 22px;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  .section-familiar {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .section-title {
    font-size: clamp(28px, 3.6vw, 40px);
    font-weight: 800;
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 44px;
  }
  .familiar-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 24px;
  }
  .familiar-card {
    padding: 28px;
  }
  .familiar-title {
    font-size: 19px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .familiar-desc {
    color: var(--ink-2);
  }
  .section-build {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    background: var(--canvas-2);
  }
  .build-subtitle {
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--ink-2);
    max-width: 620px;
    margin: 0 auto 44px;
  }
  .build-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 20px;
  }
  .build-card {
    padding: 24px;
  }
  .build-card-featured {
    border-color: var(--green-tint-2);
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--green-tint), transparent 40%), var(--card);
  }
  .build-label {
    color: var(--green-d);
  }
  .build-title {
    font-size: 18px;
    margin: 8px 0;
  }
  .build-desc {
    color: var(--ink-2);
    font-size: 14.5px;
  }
  .section-engagements {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .eng-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 24px;
  }
  .eng-card {
    padding: 28px;
  }
  .eng-num {
    font-size: 40px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--green-d);
  }
  .eng-title {
    font-size: 20px;
    margin: 14px 0 8px;
  }
  .eng-desc {
    color: var(--ink-2);
  }
  .section-proof {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .proof-wrap {
    max-width: 900px;
  }
  .proof-stats {
    margin-top: 26px;
  }
  .proof-note {
    margin-top: 30px;
    color: var(--ink-2);
  }
  .section-final-cta {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    background: var(--hero-glow);
  }
  .final-cta-wrap {
    max-width: 680px;
  }
  .final-cta-title {
    font-size: clamp(30px, 4vw, 46px);
    font-weight: 800;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .final-cta-desc {
    color: var(--ink-2);
    font-size: 18px;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
  }
  .btn-large {
    font-size: 16px;
    padding: 16px 28px;
  }
  @media(max-width:860px) {
    .hero-grid, .familiar-grid, .build-grid, .eng-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr !important;
      gap: 32px;
    }
    .stats {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      gap: 28px;
    }
  }
</style>
